232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (This internship provided practical exposure to the fields of Data Analytics and Data Science, with an emphasis on applying analytical concepts to real-world data. The primary objective of the internship was to develop practical skills in data collection, preprocessing, cleaning, analysis, visualization, and interpretation. During the internship, I gained hands-on experience with tools and technologies including Python, SQL, Microsoft Excel, and Power BI. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (I worked with structured datasets to identify trends, detect inconsistencies, generate meaningful insights, and present analytical findings through interactive dashboards and visual reports. The experience also provided an opportunity to understand how analytical techniques can support efficient decision-making in practical business scenarios. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (As part of the internship, I also developed a mini project titled "BillBuster," a web-based application designed to extract and analyze information from digital bills and receipts. The application uses Optical Character Recognition \(OCR\) to extract relevant details such as item names, prices, taxes, discounts, and total amounts. The extracted data is then cleaned and analyzed to identify useful patterns and potential anomalies, such as duplicate items, inconsistent discount calculations, and unusual values. The results are presented through simple visualizations and summarized insights to make the information easier to understand. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (The internship enhanced my understanding of the complete data analysis workflow, from raw data collection to insight generation. It also improved my problem-solving, analytical thinking, data visualization, and technical skills. Overall, the experience provided a strong foundation for applying Data Analytics and Data Science techniques to practical, user-oriented applications while strengthening my ability to communicate data-driven findings effectively. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
