/E (BillBuster is a web-based application designed to extractand analyze information from digital bills and receipts. A user captures or uploads a receipt image, and the application extracts item names, prices, taxes, discounts, and total amounts. The extracted data is cleaned, checked against validation rules, and stored in a database. The results are presented through simple visualizations and summarized insights so thatthe information is easier to understand. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (The application is built on Python and uses Pytesseract for OCR, regular expressions for entity extraction, a validation engine based on checksums and rules, SQLite as the relational store, and Plotly for the analytics dashboard. During the internship, further exposure was gained to SQL, Microsoft Excel, and Power BI, which supported the wider learning in data collection, cleaning, analysis, and visualization. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
