/T (The pipeline consists of sixstages.Image Capture receives the receipt through the camera or upload. The OCR Engine,usingPytesseract, converts the image into text. The Regex Parser extracts entities from thetextandproduces JSON. The Validation Engine applies checksums and rules to the entities.Validrecords are saved in the SQLite database, and the Plotly Dashboard displays analyticsfromthestored data. )
/E (The pipeline consists of sixstages.Image Capture receives the receipt through the camera or upload. The OCR Engine,usingPytesseract, converts the image into text. The Regex Parser extracts entities from thetextandproduces JSON. The Validation Engine applies checksums and rules to the entities.Validrecords are saved in the SQLite database, and the Plotly Dashboard displays analyticsfromthestored data. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
